Cloudflare and hosted deployments may need skill files to live outside the agent workspace/sandbox. The app should be able to provide the available skill catalog and load skill instructions/resources through trusted platform code, while keeping normal workspace file access on `SessionEnv`.

Today this is hard because skill behavior is spread across workspace discovery, packaged skills, `activate_skill`, and read-tool interception.

### Proposed direction

Could Flue introduce a public skill provider interface and have the skill system depend on it internally?

```ts
interface SkillProvider {
